{"id": "9th-u4-q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பெண்களுக்குத் தந்தை வழிச் சொத்தில் சம பங்கு உண்டு என்பதற்கான 'சொத்துரிமைச் சட்டம்' கொண்டுவரத் துணைநின்ற தமிழக முன்னோடி யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அம்புஜத்தம்மாள்", "B": "டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி", "C": "கடலூர் அஞ்சலையம்மாள்", "D": "ருக்மிணி லட்சுமிபதி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் கூற்று: பெண்களுக்குச் சொத்துரிமை வழங்கும் சட்டம் சட்டமன்றத்தில் நிறைவேற டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி துணிவுடன் குரல் கொடுத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Tamil pioneer was instrumental in passing legislation granting women inheritance rights in ancestral property?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ambujathammal", "B": "Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi", "C": "Cuddalore Anjalaiammal", "D": "Rukmini Lakshmipathi"}, "explanation": "Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi consistently fought in the assembly to secure statutory property and inheritance rights for women."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 84, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 84", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "women_education", "villuppattu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q023", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆண்கள் பல பெண்களை மணந்து பெண்களைக் கைவிடும் நிலையைத் தடுக்க 'இருதார தடைச் சட்டம்' கொண்டுவரப்பட்டதில் யாருடைய பங்கு முதன்மையானது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அன்னி பெசன்ட்", "B": "வேலு நாச்சியார்", "C": "டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி", "D": "ராணி மங்கம்மாள்"}, "explanation": "ஆண்கள் இருதார மணம் புரிவதைத் தடுக்கும் 'இருதார தடைச் சட்டம்' கொண்டுவரப்படக் காரணமாக இருந்தவர் டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whose resolute advocacy was central to the enactment of the Bigamy Prohibition Act prohibiting polygyny?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Annie Besant", "B": "Velu Nachiyar", "C": "Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi", "D": "Rani Mangammal"}, "explanation": "Dr. Muthulakshmi was the chief architect advocating the Bigamy Prohibition Act protecting vulnerable married women."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 84, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 84", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "women_education", "villuppattu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத்தில் தன் மகனைப் போர்க்களத்திற்கு அனுப்பி 'நன்னடை நல்கல் வேந்தற்குக் கடனே / வாள் உவந்து அருளல் மூதறிவாளர்க்குக் கடனே' என்று பாடிய வீராங்கனை யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெள்ளிவீதியார்", "B": "பூங்கணுத்திரையார்", "C": "மாறோக்கத்து நப்பசலையார்", "D": "பொன்முடியார் (புறநானூறு 312)"}, "explanation": "புறநானூறு 312-ஆம் பாடலில் வீரத்தாய் பொன்முடியார் தன் வீர மகனை வாள் கொடுத்துப் போர்க்களத்திற்கு அனுப்பும் கடமையைச் சாற்றியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam poetess penned Puram 312 sending her valiant son to the battle lines with armor and sword?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Velliveedhiyaar", "B": "Poonganutthiraiyaar", "C": "Maaroakkathu Nappasalaiyaar", "D": "Ponmudiyaar (Purananuru 312)"}, "explanation": "Poetess Ponmudiyaar celebrated the supreme duty of heroic mothers nurturing brave warriors for national defence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 83", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "women_education", "villuppattu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'படிக்க வேண்டும் பெண்ணே - அப்பத்தான் பார்முழுதும் போற்றிடும் கண்ணே... சொந்தக்காலில் நின்றிடவே உடனுதவும் கல்வி' - இவ்வடிகள் உணர்த்தும் உண்மை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கல்வி பெண்களின் சுயமரியாதைக்கும் தற்சார்பு வாழ்க்கைக்கும் இன்றியமையாதது", "B": "பெண்கள் ஆடை அணிகலன்கள் அணிய வேண்டும்", "C": "பெண்கள் வெளிநாடுகளுக்குச் செல்ல வேண்டும்", "D": "பெண்கள் போரில் ஈடுபட வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "பெண்கள் தாமாகச் சொந்தக் காலில் நிற்கவும், உலகமே போற்றும் சுய சிந்தனை பெறவும் கல்வி மிக இன்றியமையாதது என்று வில்லுப்பாட்டுப் பாடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What core truth does the ballad verse 'Padikka vaendum pennae... sonthakkaalil ninridavae udanudhavum kalvi' impart?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Education is essential for a woman's self-reliance, intellectual autonomy, and dignity", "B": "Women must acquire fine jewelry", "C": "Women must travel abroad", "D": "Women must enlist in military combat"}, "explanation": "The song underlines that education enables independent economic self-reliance and intellectual freedom for women."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 83", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "women_education", "villuppattu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதி வில்லுப்பாட்டில் பெண் விடுதலைக்காகக் குரல் கொடுத்த அறிஞர்களும் அவர்களின் முழக்கங்களும் எவ்வாறு பொருத்தப்பட்டுள்ளன?\n1. முடியாது பெண்ணாலே என்ற மாயையை முடக்க எழுந்தவர் - தந்தை பெரியார்\n2. விடியாது பெண்ணாலே என்ற கேலியை மிதித்துத் துவைத்தவர் - மகாகவி பாரதியார்\n3. பெண்ணடிமை தீரும்வரை மண்ணடிமை தீருமோவென இடிமுழக்கம் செய்தவர் - புரட்சிக் கவிஞர் பாரதிதாசன்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "1, 2, 3 அனைத்தும் மிகச் சரியாகப் பொருத்தப்பட்டுள்ளன", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "வில்லுப்பாட்டில் மூவரின் புரட்சி முழக்கங்களும் வரிசையாகப் பாடப்பட்டுள்ளன: பெரியார் ('முடியாது பெண்ணாலே...'), பாரதியார் ('விடியாது பெண்ணாலே...'), பாரதிதாசன் ('பெண்ணடிமை தீரும்வரை...'). எனவே மூன்றும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the social visionaries with their feminist war-cries celebrated in the Villuppattu:\n1. Shattered the illusion that women cannot achieve - Thanthai Periyar\n2. Trampled the cynical taunt that dawn cannot break through women - Mahakavi Bharati\n3. Thundered whether motherland's slavery can end before woman's bondage ends - Bharathidasan", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "All 1, 2, and 3 are perfectly matched", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are incorrect"}, "explanation": "The textbook song sequentializes the ideological breakthroughs of Periyar, Bharati, and Bharathidasan accurately."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 85, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 85", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "women_education", "villuppattu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u4-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kalviyil-sirantha-pengal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கல்வி கரையில கற்பவர் நாள்சில' - என்ற புகழ்பெற்ற பாடல் வரி இடம்பெற்றுள்ள பதினெண்கீழ்க்கணக்கு அறநூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திருக்குறள்", "B": "திரிகடுகம்", "C": "நாலடியார்", "D": "சிறுபஞ்சமூலம்"}, "explanation": "சமண முனிவர்கள் இயற்றிய நாலடியாரின் கல்வி அதிகாரத்தில் 'கல்வி கரையில கற்பவர் நாள்சில மெல்ல நினைப்பின் பிணிபல...' என்னும் புகழ்பெற்ற பாடல் வரி இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which Eighteen Lesser Texts ethical anthology does the famous dictum 'Kalvi karaiyila karpavar naalsila' (Learning knows no shore, man's days are brief) occur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thirukkural", "B": "Thirikadugam", "C": "Naaladiyaar", "D": "Sirupanchamoolam"}, "explanation": "Naaladiyaar, composed by Jain ascetics, contains the famous aphorism highlighting the vastness of knowledge versus brevity of life."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term