{"id": "9th-u4-q088", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-sixth-sense", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் கூற்றுப்படி மனிதனுக்குரிய 'ஆறாவது அறிவு' என எதனைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கண் (காணல்)", "B": "செவி (கேட்டல்)", "C": "மூக்கு (நுகர்தல்)", "D": "மனம் (பகுத்தறிதல்)"}, "explanation": "'ஆறறி வதுவே அதனொடு மனனே / நேரிதின் உணர்ந்தோர் நெறிப்படுத்தினரே' என்று தொல்காப்பியர் ஐந்து புலன் உணர்வுகளோடு 'மனம்' என்னும் பகுத்தறிவை ஆறாவது அறிவாக மனிதனுக்குக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyar, what is identified as the 'Sixth Sense' unique to human beings?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Eye (Sight)", "B": "Ear (Hearing)", "C": "Nose (Smell)", "D": "Mind (Rationality / Discernment - Manam)"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar identifies 'Manam' (the conscious rational mind / intellect) as the sixth sense added to the five physical sensory perceptions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "ch