{"id": "9th-u4-q102", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-one-sense", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் 'ஒன்றறி வதுவே உற்றறி வதுவே' என்று எந்த உறுப்பின் மூலம் அறியும் உணர்வைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாக்கு", "B": "மெய் (உடல் / தொடு உணர்வு)", "C": "செவி", "D": "மூக்கு"}, "explanation": "'உற்றறிவது' என்பது தொடு உணர்வு (மெய்) மூலம் அறியும் அறிவாகும். புல், மரம் போன்ற தாவரங்கள் தொடு உணர்வு மட்டுமே கொண்ட ஓரறிவு உயிரினங்களாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the verse 'Ondrari vadhuve uttrari vadhuve', which organ/faculty does Tholkappiyar designate as the single first sense?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tongue (Taste)", "B": "Body / Skin (Touch - Mey / Uttraridhal)", "C": "Ear (Hearing)", "D": "Nose (Smell)"}, "explanation": "'Uttraridhal' signifies tactile sensation through the body/skin, present in flora such as grass and trees."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referen