{"id": "9th-u4-q106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tholkappiyam-phonetics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியத்தில் எழுத்துகள் உடலின் எந்தெந்தப் பகுதிகளிலிருந்து பிறக்கின்றன என்பதை விளக்கும் இயல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூனமரபியல்", "B": "பிறப்பியல்", "C": "மொழிமரபியல்", "D": "தொகைமரபியல்"}, "explanation": "எழுத்ததிகாரத்தில் உள்ள 'பிறப்பியல்' என்னும் இயலில் எழுத்துக்கள் மிடறு (தொண்டை), தலை, நெஞ்சு, மூக்கு, இதழ், நாக்கு, பல், அண்ணம் ஆகியவற்றின் தொடர்பால் பிறக்கும் விதத்தை உடற்கூற்றியல் அடிப்படையில் தொல்காப்பியர் விளக்கியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which chapter of Ezhuthathikaaram in Tholkappiyam does the physiological articulation of alphabetic sounds get expounded?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Noonmarabiyal", "B": "Pirappiyal", "C": "Mozhimarabiyal", "D": "Thogaimarabiyal"}, "explanation": "'Pirappiyal' in Ezhuthathikaaram deals with articulatory phonetics, explaining how sounds originate through respiratory and vocal tract organs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 91, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 91", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "tholkappiyam", "pirappiyal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q107", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "anna-library-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): வீடுகள் தோறும் புத்தகசாலை அமைக்கப்பட வேண்டும் என்று பேரறிஞர் அண்ணா வலியுறுத்தினார்.\nகாரணம் (R): ஒரு நாட்டின் உண்மையான வலிமை அதன் ஆயுதப் பலத்தில் இல்லை; அந்நாட்டு மக்களின் சிந்திக்கும் ஆற்றலிலும் பண்பட்ட அறிவிலுமே உள்ளது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு", "C": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "D": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி"}, "explanation": "அண்ணா மக்களின் அறிவுப் புரட்சிக்கும் பண்பட்ட சிந்தனைக்கும் வீட்டிற்கோர் புத்தகசாலை அத்தியாவசியம் என்று வாதிட்டார். எனவே கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, பொருத்தமான விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Perarignar Anna passionately urged that every household should establish its own library.\nReason (R): The true strength of a nation resides not in military armaments, but in the rational reasoning and refined intellect of its enlightened citizenry.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "Both (A) and (R) are false", "C": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "D": "(A) is false, but (R) is true"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true and logically aligned; personal libraries foster intellectual resilience, which Anna viewed as the foundation of progress."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 93, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 93", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "arignar_anna", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-second-sense", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் 'இரண்டறி வதுவே அதனொடு நாவே' என்று கூறும் உயிரினங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புல், மரம்", "B": "கரையான், எறும்பு", "C": "நண்டு, தும்பி", "D": "சிப்பி, நத்தை"}, "explanation": "தொடு உணர்வுடன் சுவை உணர்வும் (நாக்கு) பெற்ற ஈரறிவு உயிரினங்களாகத் தொல்காப்பியர் 'சிப்பி' மற்றும் 'நத்தை' ஆகியவற்றை வகைப்படுத்துகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which organisms are classified under two senses ('Irandari vadhuve adhanodu naave') by Tholkappiyar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Grass, Tree", "B": "Termite, Ant", "C": "Crab, Dragonfly", "D": "Oyster, Snail"}, "explanation": "Oysters (sippi) and snails (nathai) are classified as two-sensed organisms possessing tactile and gustatory (taste) faculties."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 90", "url": null, "sou