{"id": "9th-u4-q117", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "auxiliary-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் மொழியில் ஏறத்தாழ எத்தனை துணைவினைகள் வழக்கத்தில் உள்ளன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "40 துணைவினைகள்", "B": "30 துணைவினைகள்", "C": "50 துணைவினைகள்", "D": "25 துணைவினைகள்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் மொழியில் ஏறத்தாழ நாற்பது (40) துணைவினைகள் உள்ளன. அவற்றுள் பெரும்பாலானவை முதல் வினையாகவும் செயல்படும் திறன் கொண்டவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Approximately how many auxiliary verbs (Thunai-vinaigal) are currently recognized in modern Tamil?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "40 auxiliary verbs", "B": "30 auxiliary verbs", "C": "50 auxiliary verbs", "D": "25 auxiliary verbs"}, "explanation": "In Tamil, there are approximately 40 auxiliary verbs, most of which can also function independently as primary/main verbs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": n