{"id": "9th-u4-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aux-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தன் அடிப்படைப் பொருளை விட்டுவிட்டு, முதல் வினைக்குத் துணையாக வந்து வேறு இலக்கணப் பொருளை உணர்த்தும் வினை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தனிவினை", "B": "முற்றெச்சம்", "C": "துணைவினை", "D": "பெயரெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "முதல் வினைக்குத் துணையாக வந்து, தனது அடிப்படைப் பொருளை விடுத்து, முதல் வினைக்குப் புதிய இலக்கணக் கூறையோ, பொருட்பேற்றையோ தரும் வினை 'துணைவினை' (Auxiliary Verb) ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is a verb termed that relinquishes its primary lexical meaning to accompany the main verb and add grammatical nuances?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Simple verb", "B": "Finite participle", "C": "Auxiliary verb (Thunai-vinai)", "D": "Adjectival participle"}, "explanation": "An Auxiliary Verb (Thunai-vinai) loses its literal semantic sense and attaches to the primary verb to modify aspect, mood, or modality."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 