{"id": "9th-u4-q120", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "main-vs-aux-example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கண்ணன் பாடம் எழுதிப் பார்த்தான்\" - இத்தொடரில் 'பார்த்தான்' என்பது எவ்வகை வினையாக வந்துள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தனிவினை", "B": "முதல் வினை", "C": "பிறவினை", "D": "துணைவினை"}, "explanation": "இத்தொடரில் 'எழுதி' என்பது எழுதுதல் என்னும் அடிப்படைப் பொருளைத் தரும் முதல் வினை. 'பார்த்தான்' என்பது கண்ணால் பார்த்தல் என்னும் பொருளைத் தராமல் 'முயற்சி செய்தான்' என்னும் இலக்கணப் பொருளைத் தருவதால் 'துணைவினை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the sentence \"Kannan paadam ezhudhip paarthaan\", what role does 'paarthaan' play?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Simple verb", "B": "Main verb", "C": "Causative verb", "D": "Auxiliary verb (Thunai-vinai)"}, "explanation": "'Ezhudhi' is the main verb retaining the lexical action of writing. 'Paarthaan' does not signify visual looking; it signifies 'attempted/tried', thus acting as an auxiliary verb."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q121", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "main-verb-example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நான் நேற்று ஒரு திரைப்படம் பார்த்தேன்\" - இத்தொடரில் 'பார்த்தேன்' என்பது எவ்வகை வினை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முதல் வினை", "B": "துணைவினை", "C": "கூட்டுவினை", "D": "செயப்பாட்டு வினை"}, "explanation": "இங்கு 'பார்த்தேன்' என்பது தனது நேரடியான கண்ணால் காணுதல் என்னும் அடிப்படைப் பொருளில் வெளிப்படையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'முதல் வினை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the sentence \"Naan naettru oru thiraipadam paarthoen\" (I watched a movie yesterday), what type of verb is 'paarthoen'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Main verb (Mudhal-vinai)", "B": "Auxiliary verb", "C": "Compound verb", "D": "Passive verb"}, "explanation": "'Paarthoen' functions here directly in its basic semantic sense of visual perception, qualifying it as a Main Verb (Mudhal-vinai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Ta