{"id": "9th-u4-q122", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multi_statement", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "auxiliary-characteristics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "துணைவினைகளின் பண்புகள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. துணைவினைகள் பேசுவோரின் மனநிலை, செயலின் தன்மை போன்றவற்றை உணர்த்துகின்றன.\n2. தமிழ் மொழியில் துணைவினையானது முதல் வினைக்கு முன்னதாகவே வரும்.\n3. பேச்சு மொழியிலேயே துணைவினைகளின் ஆதிக்கம் மிகுதியாகக் காணப்படுகிறது.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று 2 தவறானது. ஆங்கிலத்தில் துணைவினை முதல் வினைக்கு முன் வரும் (is writing). ஆனால் தமிழில் துணைவினை எப்போதும் முதல் வினைக்குப் பின்பே அமையும் (எழுதிக்கொண்டிருக்கிறான்). கூற்றுகள் 1 மற்றும் 3 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the following statements regarding the characteristics of Auxiliary Verbs in Tamil:\n1. Auxiliary verbs convey speaker's attitude, modality, and the aspectual manner of the action.\n2. In Tamil, the auxiliary verb strictly precedes the main verb in sentence order.\n3. Auxiliary verbs are predominantly prevalent in colloquial spoken Tamil.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "1 and 3 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement 2 is false: In Tamil, unlike English, auxiliary verbs consistently follow the main verb (e.g., ezhudhi + paarthaan). Statements 1 and 3 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "multi_statement"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q123", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aux-contrast-english", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலத்திற்கும் தமிழுக்கும் துணைவினை அமைப்பில் உள்ள முதன்மை வேறுபாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழில் துணைவினையே கிடையாது", "B": "ஆங்கிலத்தில் துணைவினை முதல் வினைக்குப் பின் வரும்; தமிழில் முன் வரும்", "C": "ஆங்கிலத்தில் துணைவினை முதல் வினைக்கு முன் வரும்; தமிழில் முதல் வினைக்குப் பின் வரும்", "D": "இரண்டு மொழிகளிலும் எந்த வேறுபாடும் இல்லை"}, "explanation": "ஆங்கிலத்தில் துணைவினை முதல் வினைக்கு முன்னதாக அமையும் (He has eaten; has - துணைவினை, eaten - முதல் வினை). தமிழில் முதல் வினைக்குப் பின்னரே துணைவினை அமையும் (அவன் சாப்பிட்டுவிட்டான்; சாப்பிட்டு - முதல் வினை, விட்டான் - துணைவினை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the principal positional difference in auxiliary verb usage between English and Tamil?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tamil has no auxiliary verbs at all", "B": "In English the auxiliary follows the main verb; in Tamil it precedes it", "C": "In English the auxiliary precedes the main verb; in Tamil it follows the main verb", "D": "There is no syntactic difference between both languages"}, "explanation": "English places auxiliaries before main verbs ('is singing'), whereas Tamil strictly places auxiliaries after main verbs ('paadik kondu irukkiraan')."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 98, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 98", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "comparative_grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q124", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-irundhaar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"வீட்டில் எல்லோரும் இருக்கிறார்கள்\" - இதில் 'இருக்கிறார்கள்' என்பது எவ்வகை வினையாக வந்துள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "துணைவினை", "B": "கூட்டுவினை", "C": "செயப்பாட்டு வினை", "D": "முதல் வினை"}, "explanation": "இத்தொடரில் 'இருக்கிறார்கள்' என்பது உயிரோடு இருத்தல் அல்லது ஓரிடத்தில் தங்கியிருத்தல் என்ற தன் நேரடியான அகராதிப் பொருளில் வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'முதல் வினை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the sentence \"Veettil ellorum irukkiraargal\" (Everyone is at home), what kind of verb is 'irukkiraargal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Auxiliary verb", "B": "Compound verb", "C": "Passive verb", "D": "Main verb (Mudhal-vinai)"}, "explanation": "'Irukkiraargal' expresses direct physical presence/location, which is its primary lexical meaning, classifying it as a Main Verb."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "ref