{"id": "9th-u4-q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-vai-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வரும் தொடர்களில் 'வை' என்னும் சொல் துணைவினையாக வந்துள்ள தொடர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புத்தகத்தை மேசை மீது வைத்தான்", "B": "அவன் பணத்தைப் பெட்டியில் வைத்தான்", "C": "அவன் பாடம் சொல்லிக் கொடுத்தவனை அழ வைத்தான்", "D": "மலர் மாலையைச் சுவரில் வைத்தான்"}, "explanation": "A, B, D ஆகிய தொடர்களில் 'வை' என்பது ஓரிடத்தில் வைத்தல் என்ற தன் அடிப்படைப் பொருளில் வந்து முதல் வினையாக உள்ளது. C தொடரில் 'அழ வைத்தான்' என்பதில் 'வைத்தான்' என்பது காரணப் பொருளை உணர்த்தும் துணைவினையாக வந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which of the following sentences does 'vai' function as an auxiliary verb?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "He placed the book on the table", "B": "He kept the money in the chest", "C": "He made the teacher cry (azha vaithaan)", "D": "He placed the garland on the wall"}, "explanation": "In A, B, and D, 'vai' acts as the primary lexical verb of physical placement. In C, 'azha vaithaan' functions as a causative auxiliary."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-kol-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அவன் தனக்குத்தானே பேசிக் கொண்டான்\" - இதில் 'கொண்டான்' என்னும் துணைவினை உணர்த்தும் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பிறர்க்குச் செய்தல்", "B": "முயற்சி செய்தல்", "C": "மறுத்துரைத்தல்", "D": "தன்வினைப் பொருள் (தன்னளவில் நிகழ்வது)"}, "explanation": "'கொண்டான்' என்னும் துணைவினை ஒரு செயல் தனக்குள்ளேயே அல்லது தன்னளவில் நிகழ்வதைக் குறிக்கும் 'தன்வினைப் பொருளில்' வருகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Avan thanakkuthaane paesik kondaan\", what semantic shade is added by the auxiliary 'kondaan'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Benefaction to others", "B": "Attempted action", "C": "Refusal", "D": "Reflexive / Self-directed action (Thanvinai)"}, "explanation": "'Kondaan' acts here as a reflexive auxiliary indicating that the action was performed for/within oneself."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference"