{"id": "9th-u4-q132", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-koodu-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நீங்கள் உள்ளே வரலாம்\" - இதில் 'வரலாம்' என்பதில் உள்ள துணைவினை உணர்த்தும் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கட்டளைப் பொருள்", "B": "சாபப் பொருள்", "C": "வேண்டுகோள் பொருள்", "D": "அனுமதிப் பொருள் (Permissive)"}, "explanation": "'வரலாம்' (வா + லாம்) என்பதில் உள்ள 'லாம்' அல்லது 'கூடும்' துணைவினை அனுமதியை (Permission) உணர்த்தும் இலக்கணப் பொருளில் வந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Neengal ullae varalaam\" (You may come in), what modality does the auxiliary signify?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Command", "B": "Curse", "C": "Supplication", "D": "Permission / Permissive modality"}, "explanation": "The auxiliary suffix in 'varalaam' indicates granting permission (permissive modality)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multi_statement", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "compound-verb-statements", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூட்டுவினைகள் பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளில் சரியானதைத் தேர்க:\n1. தனிவினை என்பது பிரிக்க முடியாத பகாப்பத வினை அடியைக் கொண்டிருக்கும்.\n2. கூட்டுவினை என்பது ஒன்றுக்கு மேற்பட்ட உறுப்புகளைக் கொண்டிருக்கும்.\n3. கூட்டுவினையில் வரும் முதல் வினைக்கு 'துணைவினை' என்றும், இரண்டாம் வினைக்கு 'முதல் வினை' என்றும் பெயர்.\nசரியான விடை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று 3 தவறானது. கூட்டுவினையில் முதல் உறுப்பாக வருவது 'முதல் வினை' (Main Verb); இரண்டாம் உறுப்பாக வருவது 'துணைவினை' (Auxiliary Verb). கூற்றுகள் 1 மற்றும் 2 முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the correct statements regarding compound verbs:\n1. A simple verb contains an indivisible root stem (Pakappadham).\n2. A compound verb contains more than one structural component.\n3. The first verb in a compound sequence is called the auxiliary verb, and the second is called the main verb.\nWhich is correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is inverted: the first constituent is the Main Verb and the second is the Auxiliary Verb. Statements 1 and 2 are true."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 96, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 96", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "multi_statement"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-podu-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"புத்தகத்தை மேசையில் போட்டான்\" - இத்தொடரில் 'போட்டான்' என்பது எவ்வகை வினை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "துணைவினை", "B": "முதல் வினை", "C": "கூட்டுவினை", "D": "பிறவினை"}, "explanation": "இத்தொடரில் 'போட்டான்' என்பது போடுதல் என்ற தன் இயல்பான முதல் நிலைப் பொருளில் வெளிப்படையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'முதல் வினை' ஆகும். (எ.கா: 'கடிதம் எழுதிப் போட்டான்' என்றால் 'போட்டான்' துணைவினை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Puthagathai maesaiyil pottaan\", what category of verb is 'pottaan'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Auxiliary verb", "B": "Main verb (Mudhal-vinai)", "C": "Compound verb", "D": "Causative verb"}, "explanation": "Here 'pottaan' retains its literal meaning of dropping/placing an object, hence it is a Main Verb."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "mudhal_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-thallu-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அவன் வேலையை முடித்துத் தள்ளினான்\" - இத்தொடரில் 'தள்ளினான்' என்னும் துணைவினை உணர்த்தும் பொருட்பாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பய உணர்வு", "B": "மெதுவாகச் செய்தல்", "C": "விரைவு அல்லது தவிர்வு (வேகமாக முடித்தல்)", "D": "மகிழ்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "'முடித்துத் தள்ளினான்' என்பதில் உள்ள 'தள்ளினான்' என்னும் துணைவினை ஒரு வேலையை விரைவாக, வேகத்தோடு செய்து முடித்தலைக் குறிக்கும் விரைவுப் பொருளில் வந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Avan vaelaiyai mudithuth thallinaan\", what nuance does the auxiliary 'thallinaan' express?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Apprehension", "B": "Leisurely pace", "C": "Rapidity / Hasty dispatch (Viraivu)", "D": "Euphoria"}, "explanation": "'Thallinaan' attached to 'mudithu' imparts the nuance of dispatching the work with brisk rapidity and urgency."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-koodum-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நாளை மழை பெய்யக்கூடும்\" - இத்தொடரில் 'கூடும்' என்னும் துணைவினை உணர்த்தும் இலக்கணப் பண்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உறுதிப்பாடு", "B": "கட்டளை", "C": "அனுமதி", "D": "சாத்தியக்கூறு அல்லது ஐயம் (Possibility / Probability)"}, "explanation": "'பெய்யக்கூடும்' என்பதில் உள்ள 'கூடும்' துணைவினை ஒரு செயல் உறுதியாக நடக்கும் என்று கூறாமல், நடப்பதற்கான சாத்தியக்கூறை (Possibility) உணர்த்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Naalai mazhai peyyakkoodum\", what modality does 'koodum' convey?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Absolute certainty", "B": "Imperative command", "C": "Permission", "D": "Possibility / Probability"}, "explanation": "'Koodum' functions as an epistemic modal auxiliary expressing possibility/likelihood."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thunai-vinai-definition-textbook", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒரு கூட்டுவினையின் முதல் உறுப்பாக வந்து தன் அடிப்படைப் பொருளைத் தரும் வினை முதல் வினை; இரண்டாவது உறுப்பாக வந்து தன் அடிப்படைப் பொருளை விடுத்து இலக்கணப் பொருளைத் தரும் வினை __________ ஆகும்.\"", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "துணைவினை", "B": "தனிவினை", "C": "பிறவினை", "D": "பெயரெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இலக்கண விளக்கத்தின்படி, இரண்டாவது உறுப்பாக வந்து தனது அடிப்படைப் பொருளை விடுத்து இலக்கணப் பொருளைத் தரும் வினை 'துணைவினை' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"The verb that occurs as the second constituent of a compound verb, loses its primary lexical sense, and conveys grammatical aspect is __________.\"", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Auxiliary verb (Thunai-vinai)", "B": "Simple verb", "C": "Causative verb", "D": "Adjectival participle"}, "explanation": "As formulated in the textbook, the second component that divests itself of literal meaning to provide grammatical modality is an auxiliary verb."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "thunai_vinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aux-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தமிழ் மொழியில் ஏறத்தாழ 40 துணைவினைகள் உள்ளன.\nகாரணம் (R): இந்தத் துணைவினைகளில் பெரும்பாலானவை தன்னிச்சையாக முதல் வினையாகவும் தொழிற்படும் இருமைத் தன்மை கொண்டவை.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "C": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "தமிழில் உள்ள 40 துணைவினைகளில் பெரும்பான்மையானவை (இரு, வை, கொள், போ, வா, விடு முதலியன) தனித்து நின்று முதல் வினையாகவும் செயல்படும் ஆற்றல் கொண்டவை. கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, தக்க விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): There are approximately 40 auxiliary verbs in Tamil.\nReason (R): Most of these auxiliary verbs possess a dual character, capable of also operating independently as primary/main verbs.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are factually accurate; verbs such as 'iru', 'vai', 'kol', 'kodu' serve both lexical main and auxiliary grammatical functions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "grammar", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
