{"id": "9th-u4-q151", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "book-back-evaluation-q4", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பெண்ணடிமை தீரும் வரை மண்ணடிமை தீருமோ என வெடித்தவர் யார்?\" (அல்லது 'பெண் கல்வி வேண்டும் எனப் பாடியவர்')", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுப்பிரமணிய பாரதியார்", "B": "கவிமணி", "C": "புரட்சிக்கவிஞர் பாரதிதாசன்", "D": "நாமக்கல் கவிஞர்"}, "explanation": "'பெண்ணடிமை தீரும் வரை மண்ணடிமை தீருமோ' என்று பெண்ணடிமைத்தனத்தை எதிர்த்து முழங்கியவர் புரட்சிக் கவிஞர் பாரதிதாசன் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Will the slavery of our land end before the subjugation of women is eradicated?\" - Who uttered this fiery question?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Subramania Bharati", "B": "Kavimani", "C": "Puratchi Kavignar Bharathidasan", "D": "Namakkal Kavignar"}, "explanation": "Revolutionary poet Bharathidasan connected national liberation inextricably to the emancipation of women."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 99, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 99", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "bharathidasan", "quotations"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q152", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-muthulakshmi-devadasi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] சென்னை சட்டமன்றத்தில் டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி அவர்கள் தேவதாசி முறை ஒழிப்பு மசோதாவை முன்மொழிந்த ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1926", "B": "1928", "C": "1929", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி 1930 ஆம் ஆண்டு சென்னை சட்டமன்றத்தில் தேவதாசி முறை ஒழிப்பு மசோதாவை முன்மொழிந்தார். இச்சட்டம் பல்வேறு போராட்டங்களுக்குப் பிறகு 1947-ல் நிறைவேறியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Previous Year Question] In which year did Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi introduce the Devadasi System Abolition Bill in the Madras Legislative Council?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1926", "B": "1928", "C": "1929", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi moved the historic resolution to abolish the Devadasi system in 1930, which culminated in the Madras Devadasis (Prevention of Dedication) Act of 1947."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 83", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2", "exam_name": null, "year": "2018-2022", "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "pyq", "muthulakshmi_reddi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q153", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-moovalur-scheme", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] தமிழக அரசு மூவலூர் ராமாமிர்தம் அம்மையாரின் பெயரில் வழங்கி வந்த திருமண உதவித் திட்டத்தை, மாணவிகளின் உயர்கல்வியை உறுதி செய்யும் திட்டமாக மாற்றியமைத்த திட்டத்தின் பெயர் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புதுமைப்பெண் திட்டம் (உயர்கல்வி உறுதித் திட்டம்)", "B": "தமிழ்ப் புதல்வன் திட்டம்", "C": "அன்னை தெரசா திட்டம்", "D": "டாக்டர் தர்மாம்பாள் திட்டம்"}, "explanation": "தமிழக அரசு அரசுப் பள்ளிகளில் பயின்று உயர்கல்வி சேரும் மாணவிகளுக்கு மாதம் ரூ.1,000 வழங்கும் 'மூவலூர் ராமாமிர்தம் அம்மையார் உயர்கல்வி உறுதித் திட்டத்தை' (புதுமைப்பெண் திட்டம்) நடைமுறைப்படுத்தியுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Previous Year Question] Into which scheme did the Tamil Nadu Government revamp the Moovalur Ramamirtham Ammaiyar Marriage Assistance Scheme to ensure female higher education?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pudhumai Penn Scheme (Higher Education Assurance Scheme)", "B": "Tamil Pudhalvan Scheme", "C": "Mother Teresa Scheme", "D": "Dr. Dharmambal Scheme"}, "explanation": "The Tamil Nadu Government restructured the Moovalur Ramamirtham Ammaiyar scheme into the 'Pudhumai Penn' Higher Education Assurance Scheme providing Rs. 1,000/month to girl students."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "exp